OL,3,ARussian foreign minister questions
OL,4,A'what will become of UK' and future of
OL,5,A'the Celts'
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia's foreign minister has
OL,8,Fquestioned the future of the UK,
OL,9,Fsuggesting it looks uncertain with "the
OL,10,FCelts" looking to hold independence
OL,11,Freferendums.
OL,13,FSergey Lavrov made the comments at a
OL,14,Fyouth conference where he said he did
OL,15,F"not know what will become of the
OL,16,Fcountry called Great Britain",
OL,17,Faccording to The Times.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
