OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussian foreign minister questions
OL,4,A'what will become of UK' and future of
OL,5,A'the Celts'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comments come weeks after the first
OL,8,Fministers of Wales, Scotland and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland declared
OL,10,F"Westminster's time is coming to an
OL,11,Fend" and signed an agreement to say it
OL,12,Fhad no right to "block democracy".
OL,14,FIn response to Lavrov's comments, Plaid
OL,15,FCymru said Wales' constitutional future
OL,16,Fwas "a matter for the people of Wales",
OL,17,Fand "not for the Kremlin to endorse,
OL,18,Foppose or exploit".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
